# Defaults: web development 5173, game server 2567.
# Frontend and server share the same origin through the Vite proxy.
# For a separately hosted game server, set this before building the web app:
# VITE_SERVER_URL=wss://your-game-server.example.com
# Production server: PORT=2567 npm start

# EC2 production backend (mandatory when NODE_ENV=production):
# ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://oddbid.vercel.app,https://your-frontend.example.com
# APP_REVISION=<deployed Git commit SHA>
# Production env setup: see deploy/server.env.example and docs/DEPLOYMENT.md.
# The Node server reads process environment, not this file automatically.
